note.p:
Source: Department of State, Central Files, 770G.00/12–2062. Top Secret;
                    Priority; Eyes Only. Drafted by Sisco;
                    cleared by Cleveland, Williams, Andrews, and McGhee; and approved by Rusk. An attached note from the Department of
                    State duty officer to Brubeck states that
                        Rusk had directed that the telegram
                    should not be repeated to USUN for Stevenson and to Léopoldville for Gullion, as the telegram had indicated.
